{"path":"io/basic_ios/imbue","title":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::imbue","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_ios&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>imbue","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/basic_ios/imbue","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Replaces the current locale. Effectively calls ios_base::imbue(loc) and if there is an associated stream buffer (rdbuf() != 0), then calls rdbuf()->pubimbue(loc).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a> imbue<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> loc <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Replaces the current locale. Effectively calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ios_base<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and if there is an associated stream buffer (<code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span></span></code>), then calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rdbuf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>pubimbue<span class=\"br0\">(</span>loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> loc\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the new locale\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The previous locale, as returned by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ios_base<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>loc<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istringstream\"><span class=\"kw1752\">std::<span class=\"me2\">istringstream</span></span></a> iss<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    iss.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.UTF8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Current locale: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> iss.<span class=\"me1\">getloc</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">name</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    iss.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Global locale&nbsp;: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> iss.<span class=\"me1\">getloc</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">name</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Current locale: en_US.UTF8\nGlobal locale&nbsp;: C</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/basic_ios","title":"std::basic_ios"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_ios<CharT,Traits>::imbue","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Replaces the current locale."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"loc"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The previous locale, as returned by ios_base::imbue(loc)."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":89,"codeBlockCount":2}
